<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40857" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">rĕfŭgus</span></b> , a,
		um, adj.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>fleeing back</i>, <i>fleeing away</i>, <i>receding</i>, <i>vanishing</i> (<b>poet.</b> and in post-Aug. prose; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">not in Virg. or Hor.): unda,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. M.
					10, 42</span></i>
			; cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">flumen (with fugientia poma),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					H. 18, 182</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fluctus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Luc.
					1, 411</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Nilus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 8,
					526</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mare,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Stat.
					Th. 12, 634</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">latices,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Claud. in Ruf. 2, 509</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Nilus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					Pan. 30, 4</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">equites irritato proelio sponte refugi,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tac. H.
					2, 24</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">umbra,</span>”
				<i>vanishing</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Val.
					Fl. 4, 41</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">refugosque gerens a fronte capillos,</span>”
				<i>flying back</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Luc.
					10, 132</span></i>
			.— With <i>gen.</i> (late Lat.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">jejunii,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ambros. in Psa. 118</span></i>
			, Serm. 20, § 4.—<i>Subst.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">rĕfŭgus</span></b> , i,
			m.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">refugos sequi,</span>”
				<i>fugitives</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Tac.
					A. 13, 40</span></i>
			; cf. <i><span class="en">id. H. 3, 61</span></i>.</div>
